    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d819">

                <pb facs="0970" n="890" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg890"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Shah of Persia to
                        President Roosevelt.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-09-04"><hi rendition="#italic">September 4,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I am infinitely sorry for the untoward mishap, and happy to hear that injury is
                    slight. Wish Your Excellency speedy recovery.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mouzaffer
                    ed-dine.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
